  "job_B15.6.20_20251003_114330": {
    "text": "On Godes \u00e6lmihtiges naman.\nIc \u00e6\u00feestan \u00e6\u00feeling geswutelige on \u00feysum gewrite hu ic mine are & mine \u00e6hta geunnen h\u00e6bbe Gode to\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t ic geann \u00fe\u00e6t man gefreoge \u00e6lcne witef\u00e6stne mann \u00fee ic on spr\u00e6ce ahte.\n& ic geann in mid me \u00fe\u00e6r ic me reste Criste & sancte petre \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Eadburgebyrig \u00fee ic gebohte\n& \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Merelafan \u00fee ic gebohte \u00e6t minum f\u00e6der mid \u00feridde healf hund mancosan goldes be\n& ic hine \u00fe\u00e6s bidde for Godes lufan & for sancta Marian & for sancte Petres \u00fe\u00e6t hit standan mote.\n& \u00fe\u00e6s swurdes mid \u00feam sylfrenan hiltan \u00fee Wulfric worhte & \u00feone gyldenan fetels & \u00fe\u00e6ne beh \u00fee\n& ic wille \u00fe\u00e6t man nime \u00fe\u00e6t feoh \u00fee A\u00feelwoldes laf me ah to gyldene \u00fee ic for hyre are gesceoten\n& ic geann into Cristes cyrican on Cantwarabyrig \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Holungaburnan & \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6rto hyr\u00f0\n& ic ann \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Hry\u00f0erafelda into nunnan mynstre Sancta Marian \u00feances & \u00e6nne sylfrene mele\n& ic geann to Sceaftenesbyrig to \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode & to sancte Eadwearde \u00feara VI punda \u00fee ic\n& ic geann minon f\u00e6der \u00e6\u00feelr\u00e6de cynge \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Cealhtune buton \u00feam ehta hidan \u00fee ic \u00e6lm\u00e6re\n& ic geann Eadmunde minon bre\u00f0er \u00fe\u00e6s swurdes \u00fee Offa cyng ahte & \u00fe\u00e6s swurdes mid \u00feam pyttedan\n& ic wylle \u00fe\u00e6t mon gel\u00e6ste \u00e6lce geare ane d\u00e6gfeorme \u00feam hirede into Elig of \u00feysse are on Sancte\n& gif \u00fea nella\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6lmessan gefor\u00f0ian \u00fee \u00fea land habba\u00f0 gange seo ar into sancte \u00e6\u00feeldry\u00f0e.\n& ic geann Eadwige minon bre\u00f0er anes seolforhiltes swurdes.\n& ic geann \u00e6lfsige bisceope \u00fe\u00e6re gyldenan rode \u00fee is mid Eadrice Wynfl\u00e6de suna & anne blacne\n& ic geann \u00e6lm\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Hamelandene \u00fee he \u00e6r ahte.\n& ic bidde minne f\u00e6der fur Godes \u00e6lmihtiges lufan & fur minon \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s geunne \u00fee ic him geunnen\n& ic geann Godwine Wulfno\u00f0es suna \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Cumtune \u00fee his f\u00e6der \u00e6r ahte.\n& ic geann \u00e6lfswy\u00f0e minre fostermeder for hire myclon geearnungon \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Westune \u00fee ic\n& ic gean \u00e6lfwine minon m\u00e6ssepreoste \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Heorulfestune & \u00fe\u00e6s malswurdes \u00fee Wi\u00f0er ahte\n& ic geann \u00e6lm\u00e6re minon disc\u00feene \u00feara ehta hida \u00e6t Cateringatune & anes fagan stedan & \u00fe\u00e6s\n& ic geann Sifer\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Hocganclife & anes swurdes & anes horses & mines bohscyldes.\n& ic geann \u00e6\u00feelwerde Stameran & Lyfingce \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Tywingan.\n& ic ann Leofstane Leofwines bre\u00f0er Cwattes \u00fe\u00e6re landare \u00fee ic of his bre\u00f0er nam.\n& ic geann Leomm\u00e6re \u00e6t Biggrafan \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00fee ic him \u00e6r of nam.\n& ic geann Godwine Dreflan \u00feara \u00fereora hida \u00e6t Lutegaresheale.\n& ic geann Eadrice Wynfl\u00e6de Sunu \u00fe\u00e6s swurdes \u00fee seo hand is on gemearcod.\n& ic geann \u00e6\u00feelwine minon cnihte \u00fe\u00e6s swurdes \u00fee he me \u00e6r sealde.\n& ic geann \u00e6lfno\u00f0e minon swurdhwitan \u00fe\u00e6s sceardan malswurdes & minon heardeorhunton \u00fe\u00e6s stodes\n& gehealde mon of minon golde \u00e6lfric \u00e6t Bertune & Godwine Drefelan \u00e6t swa miclon swa Eadmund\nNu \u00feancige ic minon f\u00e6der mid ealre eadmodnesse on Godes \u00e6lmihtiges naman \u00fe\u00e6re andsware \u00fee he\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t he me cydde mines f\u00e6der worde \u00fe\u00e6t ic moste be Godes leafe & be his geunnan minre are\n& \u00feysse andsware is to gewitnesse Eadmund min bro\u00f0or & \u00e6lfsige bisceop & Byrhtm\u00e6r abbod &\nNu bidde ic ealle \u00fea witan \u00fee minne cwyde gehyron r\u00e6dan \u00e6g\u00f0er ge gehadode ge l\u00e6wede \u00fe\u00e6t hi beon\nNu cy\u00f0e ic \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00fea \u00feingc \u00fee ic to Gode into Godes cyrican & Godes \u00feeowan geunnen h\u00e6bbe sy\n& se \u00fee \u00feysne cwyde \u00feurh \u00e6nig \u00feingc awende habbe him wi\u00f0 God \u00e6lmihtigne gem\u00e6ne & wi\u00f0 Sancta",
